[agent] The training dataset **`churntrainingc8f821`, version 1** now exists on the platform, verified by reading it back through `hops td read`:
[agent] - **Exactly the 9 required columns**, in order: `account_id, label_time, amount, balance, credit_score, tier, sessions_7d, health_score, churned`
